stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: Video project states
    accDescr: A project moves from uploading to preparing to ready, or to rejected when the media cannot be used. Deletion hides it at once and cleans up later.
    [*] --> draft: clip saved on the phone
    draft --> uploading: project created, TUS transfer
    uploading --> uploading: pause in background, resume with a fresh capability
    uploading --> preparing: finalize verified size and hash
    preparing --> ready: prepared video and previews published
    preparing --> rejected: invalid_media, unsupported_media, file or processing limits
    preparing --> preparing: preparation_unavailable, retried
    ready --> preparing: a new source replaces the video
    uploading --> deleting: owner deletes
    preparing --> deleting: owner deletes
    ready --> deleting: owner deletes
    rejected --> deleting: owner deletes
    deleting --> deleted: files verified absent
    deleted --> [*]
